# Allow-list: send ONLY the app/ folder to Docker as the build context.
# Everything else (.git history, Terraform state, Jenkins files, docs, local
# virtualenvs, secrets) stays out of the image and out of the build.
*
!app/

# ...but not the tests or Python caches inside app/
app/tests/
app/pytest.ini
app/requirements-dev.txt
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
